# A variable from outside a loop given a loan in its body: the next pass
# would start with it a loan, which the body before the assignment wasn't
# compiled for.
include 'ctxrule.lmi'

C: ctx = new ctx()
C->L = new list<str>()
X: list<str> = new list<str>()
I: int = 0
while ( I < 2 ) {
	X = C->L
	I = I + 1
}
##### COMP_ERR #####
10:1: X takes a loan on C in the loop's body (11:2), and still holds it at its end
